    "title": "City of Marquette prepares for downtown New Year's Eve ball drop - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Trevor Sugden ,\n6 hours ago MARQUETTE, Mich. (WLUC) - On West Washington Street Wednesaday, final preparations began to set up for the ball drop. Double Trouble Entertainment has been out since 8 a.m., setting the stage for Wednesday’s big activities. Double Trouble says they have had a successful morning. Their crew got there early and hit the ground running, which was great news for General Manager Ross Johnson. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
